    "1_5_001tom_1_5_001_00_8": {
      "revision": "sha256:b3d5983be948daf83140c4fcf50d52b1596d8f0162b08b4e4feea45b38034086",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_00_8:1_5_001_00_8:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "まだまだ出来ないことはたくさんあるからな！\n出来る事が増えるって、すげー楽しいんだぜ！",
        "text": "我还远远有很多做不到的事呢！\n能做到的事一点点变多，真的超级开心啊！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:43bca107069fe43a20270781753392f9160823db4b3355b600cec4168e55cf49",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_00_8:1_5_001_00_8:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_002sht_1_5_002_00_3": {
      "revision": "sha256:d48c35556696335ded490a6643f969ee181ad64f1714777b29ad8cf8e15fe71f",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_002sht_1_5_002_00_3:1_5_002_00_3:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "プロデューサーさん！\n始まる前には起きるからちょっとだけ寝させて～。",
        "text": "制作人！\n开始前我会起来的，让我稍微睡一会儿嘛～",
        "source_hash": "sha256:f71826b38e1718866bfef64f8e2961da24a704800c3704f6083230e6adb5ae30",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_002sht_1_5_002_00_3:1_5_002_00_3:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_003hok_1_5_003_00_2": {
      "revision": "sha256:b1cac4868ba3dbb81428c93d90f1f7f8a3d47838a3520e0fad4d42a0422b6d30",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_003hok_1_5_003_00_2:1_5_003_00_2:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "今日もプリンセスたちを幸せにしてきますね。\nええ、任せてください。",
        "text": "今天我也去让公主们幸福了哦。\n嗯，交给我吧。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:389c0a894bc4fcac81c9082c846071eb7a14545b1ab519562abf38668154207a",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_003hok_1_5_003_00_2:1_5_003_00_2:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_00_6": {
      "revision": "sha256:82919ec58d6004e241fbdeee6b57db1c3d3ac172c5c6edb811f8c34bd1aebb5b",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_00_6:1_5_006_00_6:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "いいお天気ですね、レッスン日和です！\nウォーミングアップに少し走ってきますね。",
        "text": "天气真好呢，真是适合练习的日子！\n我去稍微跑跑步当热身。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:7bbc788524ddaa5fdb716982353b3961e5d782eef7cd3cce9d13cb23198b68fe",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_00_6:1_5_006_00_6:cmd-000018:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_03": {
      "revision": "sha256:fb0cc8cd4a518e0a276383f5151004b0209d7f62da0176082dffee41455e3505",
      "title": 200,
      "opening": {
        "source": "見てください、こんなに分厚いお肉が\nワンコインなんて……早速いただきますね。",
        "text": "请大家看，这么厚的肉居然只要\n一枚硬币……我马上尝尝看。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:03e59fbdb75b2ea7ee845c3332310d27284160ad4513ba12665930256f7ccb95",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_03:1_5_006_03:cmd-000020:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_008rei_1_5_008_00_2": {
      "revision": "sha256:4ad7c88aa1ad37597be4d4d77deb3927f24faa8e2a35f6e564e00fedd603e04a",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_008rei_1_5_008_00_2:1_5_008_00_2:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "貴殿が用意してくれたステージで\n最高の音楽を奏でてこよう。",
        "text": "在阁下为我们准备的舞台上，\n去奏响最棒的音乐吧。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:4a4c6fed6a27cca0e1875927663459738df29fcdc558309176a4d3a7e26dc826",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_008rei_1_5_008_00_2:1_5_008_00_2:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_011min_1_5_011_00_2": {
      "revision": "sha256:14c36c2ce6f7d94077843d25dea9be1e14f5c615ba3f70c5d743f236eb20114e",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_011min_1_5_011_00_2:1_5_011_00_2:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "お客さんを楽しませるためには、\nまず自分が楽しむことが大事だよね。",
        "text": "为了让客人开心，\n首先自己乐在其中是很重要的呢。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:61112bf49f58d8783e93e9babf03d230d0d1c921d457215cc8b9f02724786d5c",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_011min_1_5_011_00_2:1_5_011_00_2:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_012yus_1_5_012_02": {
      "revision": "sha256:b0ebf9e07380a277f44225fbbb697da38d1452dd91d452d9e904e55092b96aa7",
      "title": 223,
      "opening": {
        "source": "はぁ～～～。\n緊張しすぎて心臓がバクバクしてきたぁ。",
        "text": "哈～～～\n太紧张了心跳砰砰直跳啊。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:fdcdd24ff9fcc5a0e56c150d07a6590f85abdfd8359d209f24aa5a9012bf29c3",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_012yus_1_5_012_02:1_5_012_02:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_013kys_1_5_013_00_3": {
      "revision": "sha256:8b65f350077dd0565d7b75f4a9a3426649b54667850eb8e60982dbfcf6ede0d0",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_013kys_1_5_013_00_3:1_5_013_00_3:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "世界一の双子ユニットになる俺たちのステージ、\nちゃんと見ててよね！",
        "text": "我们可是要成为世界第一的双子组合的，\n一定要好好看着我们的舞台哦！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:b8df1776de03b6157fd78b74171655ffe556138b6b85020525b90d13adedddb2",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_013kys_1_5_013_00_3:1_5_013_00_3:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_014hid_1_5_014_00_5": {
      "revision": "sha256:aacc94333f6a611d5c6a39a2d1ae893a9f93276747e2116688168b469b2cf423",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_00_5:1_5_014_00_5:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "ここへ来る前に、うちのドーベルマンと散歩して\nきたんだ。ウォーミングアップはバッチリだぜ。",
        "text": "来这里之前，我带着家里的杜宾犬去散了步。\n热身已经做得妥妥的了。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c182893f825727b47dd79c82eecc6bb4e05db6ab6840d71ddb55aad88ef2dc17",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_00_5:1_5_014_00_5:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_014hid_1_5_014_04": {
      "revision": "sha256:355142ad69696f208811c0cee2457a7e6a0506447b394c52fa7a20811ce2caee",
      "title": 233,
      "opening": {
        "source": "なぁ、●●●●プロデューサー。さっき収録中に\n話しかけた地元の人に聞いたんだけどさ……。",
        "text": "那个，●●●●プロデューサー。我刚才听录制时搭话的当地人说啊……",
        "source_hash": "sha256:8c4ca8dffe26f2cc1950a1407a8a3522effba8feeb5cb306fe02bd523467a69f",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_04:1_5_014_04:cmd-000018:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_00_6": {
      "revision": "sha256:8461b2dca40d9324d6b4c7e922c6477b1be54b24b0b28be462e465950d22b6e6",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_00_6:1_5_015_00_6:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "どんな不運があろうとも俺はくじけないぞ！\n諦めない心こそ、前進する力になるんだ！",
        "text": "不管遇到什么不幸，我都绝不会气馁！\n永不放弃的心，才是前进的动力！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:d12bdcaf0318e6205f309bedccb2bbf9e6159fc4ca34a328fdfab9b8c568ea67",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_00_6:1_5_015_00_6:cmd-000018:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_03": {
      "revision": "sha256:851fb530f62d2d0271c1c553fd3e79db93043881dcfdbe7b7406996f522ff061",
      "title": 236,
      "opening": {
        "source": "今日は老舗和食店の職人さんを\n紹介するんだよな！",
        "text": "今天要去介绍老字号日料店的手艺人师傅呢！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:9e60de62772fcc480d13334d46dc603948b4f737a9b82cde2108aa572e4acad1",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_03:1_5_015_03:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_016sei_1_5_016_00_3": {
      "revision": "sha256:9c305822945e5556fcf2f91383358a4e7a256278901942a128479b6b662a4e36",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_016sei_1_5_016_00_3:1_5_016_00_3:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "ふぅ……本番前はやっぱり緊張するが……\nしっかり任務をこなしてくる！",
        "text": "呼……正式上场前果然还是会紧张啊……\n不过我会好好完成任务的！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:b8961afa4250d277c658decdd5519303eab467aeb3a237a20e3171bd1cbc686d",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_016sei_1_5_016_00_3:1_5_016_00_3:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_017kir_1_5_017_00_0": {
      "revision": "sha256:59bd5ac1c61667430e782fb36a6fdc103d18124edf20f07b0a2d87c5d71748ee",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_00_0:1_5_017_00_0:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "プロデューサークン、ワガハイ\nもっといろんな仕事をしたいでにゃんす！",
        "text": "制作人君，吾辈\n还想接更多更多的工作喵！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:6c44357bc1c0224ec4f09263063983d9d15c0ab8ec08bfa6c12fa87772246187",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_00_0:1_5_017_00_0:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_017kir_1_5_017_01": {
      "revision": "sha256:9a789ada6490b64c5c742fab9752d39acd9adae72dcfcd4e5ee48ce095cd26de",
      "title": 242,
      "opening": {
        "source": "にゃはっ、今日はらーめん屋の食れぽを\nするでにゃんす～♪",
        "text": "喵哈哈，今天要做拉面店的美食测评\n喵～♪",
        "source_hash": "sha256:500a469e7e81ffaa2c71dd88f5a9d1d0a5bd4930d37856525e3993fddb8b6dfa",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_01:1_5_017_01:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_018shm_1_5_018_00_6": {
      "revision": "sha256:e87ae6aebfb6b5e43c0509b8659f4c407a150624e52697627ae98b56646c9f2f",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_00_6:1_5_018_00_6:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "実家が米農家だからか、\nついロケ弁でお米の産地を見ちゃうのよねぇ…。",
        "text": "大概是因为老家是种稻子的吧，\n一看到外景便当，就会忍不住去看大米的产地呢……",
        "source_hash": "sha256:3594585065a05e1d77a91cb6dacf47b4a76615cf147a3fa31de89da80cd30c05",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_00_6:1_5_018_00_6:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_018shm_1_5_018_03": {
      "revision": "sha256:98367fa06804eee97445f4b8d75cab0e2aa86b78d3d628a87bf1d86c21996439",
      "title": 248,
      "opening": {
        "source": "翔真さん、お待たせしました。\nこちらが今回出演する恋愛ドラマの台本です。",
        "text": "翔真先生，让您久等了。\n这是这次要出演的爱情剧的剧本。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:25756c5de989682c2f055804c8c720b340427ee87f12e29760313232e1ad8678",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_03:1_5_018_03:cmd-000018:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_019kur_1_5_019_00_8": {
      "revision": "sha256:30aa2aeff76ff5e4491445f9220b0dacf4fa7dd457ba2015b6fb3ddcb5d39db2",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_019kur_1_5_019_00_8:1_5_019_00_8:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "猫柳さんは自由奔放な方で……。いえ、仕事としても\nその発想力には学ぶところがあります。",
        "text": "猫柳先生是个自由奔放的人……不，即便从工作的角度来看，\n他的那种奇思妙想也有很多值得学习的地方。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:d8530895476821ba197da457168951adcebeb82877240d3ee1e296287b569d94",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_019kur_1_5_019_00_8:1_5_019_00_8:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_020hay_1_5_020_00_0": {
      "revision": "sha256:70d3a811e6aefb951e325e69ccac87bac4e97ddf554c6c01bc8b2196baaa6d09",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_020hay_1_5_020_00_0:1_5_020_00_0:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "無事に収録が終わってよかったー。\nオンエア、楽しみだな。",
        "text": "录制顺利结束真是太好了——\n好期待播出啊。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:84b808d8a814b6859f883b1e5165c2f86b1c5008aa17d2610d646a14f731b4c5",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_020hay_1_5_020_00_0:1_5_020_00_0:cmd-000019:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_020hay_1_5_020_01": {
      "revision": "sha256:d1af2a793c6453b3e672c6ecf5bf8e2cb501ec2d56f50ad3bbffe6a5d897800a",
      "title": 254,
      "opening": {
        "source": "うーん、なかなか連鎖が繋がらないな……。\n……あ、こうすればいいんだ！　よし、クリア！",
        "text": "唔——，总感觉连击连不上啊……\n……啊，这样做就行了！好嘞，通关！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:2d9633f4bfe701297ca734f598ddbf667361a474f7f1c4f61cf55ade9ef993b9",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_020hay_1_5_020_01:1_5_020_01:cmd-000021:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_022nat_1_5_022_00_5": {
      "revision": "sha256:3f012b8f16abb2079f5c8e990329b25590a6f2a8b505af0c39880e58c9122c8b",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_022nat_1_5_022_00_5:1_5_022_00_5:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "……●●●●プロデューサーさん。\n今日の仕事も、頑張るね……。",
        "text": "……●●●●プロデューサー。\n今天的工作，我也会加油的……",
        "source_hash": "sha256:d02073e36bd1dd0043d085f0d80955fb25d23b1de9bca1fc6737c33cefd69987",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_022nat_1_5_022_00_5:1_5_022_00_5:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_022nat_1_5_022_04": {
      "revision": "sha256:a3825e27457b481b27438d3e14dd34d66bb91265bb4fa0d68faa2ea055c8157a",
      "title": 265,
      "opening": {
        "source": "夏来さん、撮影お疲れさまでした！",
        "text": "夏来先生，拍摄辛苦了！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:e2b1babd08c817012b79351565bc8af7359ce6a52dc9fa90094a83dc092cef14",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_022nat_1_5_022_04:1_5_022_04:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_023har_1_5_023_02": {
      "revision": "sha256:efa464735ccd8e6ff7722761f5cf0d7472bbb93a519d6f46a57ed4f888069a15",
      "title": 267,
      "opening": {
        "source": "●●●●プロデューサー、お疲れさま。\nその荷物、今届いたのか？",
        "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦啦。\n那个包裹是刚送到的吗？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:0752ae6e462d03f8352a51ea08054ea1aa3ca4ac5729e5ba8c9398767c1e43c1",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_023har_1_5_023_02:1_5_023_02:cmd-000019:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_024shk_1_5_024_00_2": {
      "revision": "sha256:9803d3b27567134bffe71f5931b174d792886131d6eee91c17d7c9a272b87682",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_00_2:1_5_024_00_2:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "お客さんのテンションがメガMAXで、\nチョー気持ちよかったっす！",
        "text": "观众们的情绪嗨到Mega MAX，\n超爽快的！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:6379f8341c202dffc56656d38aab52c4b5293b42d880812e905919b7b171c51a",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_00_2:1_5_024_00_2:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_027yuk_1_5_027_02": {
      "revision": "sha256:56e288de9f06ff6aa1a07fdee404f68a61b12a6249a55d27c06e1ae878689844",
      "title": 283,
      "opening": {
        "source": "リハーサル中の幸広さん、すごかったです！\n仮の問題でしたが、いくつも当てていましたよね。",
        "text": "彩排时的幸广先生太厉害了！\n虽然只是模拟问题，但您答对了好几道呢。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:dff8d8796989ac8061bebd0c3a4c47c2795acba3627aec507ab61577b1b9e4db",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_027yuk_1_5_027_02:1_5_027_02:cmd-000014:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_028soi_1_5_028_02": {
      "revision": "sha256:3023ee513cf389bd7df1728a4bc27685ecd5db892305cec384794a3929ef3bb7",
      "title": 287,
      "opening": {
        "source": "すみません、●●●●プロデューサーさん。\n収録現場を見たいと無理を言ってしまって。",
        "text": "不好意思，●●●●プロデューサー。\n任性地提出想去看看录制现场。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:4a4ab100b5c7867994ec05b34a69addcdad1c72c675dfb8d036ed09e7b37cee3",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_028soi_1_5_028_02:1_5_028_02:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_032nao_1_5_032_00_2": {
      "revision": "sha256:d622e0c8c14b3a8a838e6d8c44909d4465c275b234aa233e188d808404eabc24",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_032nao_1_5_032_00_2:1_5_032_00_2:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "●●●●プロデューサーさん、\nいつも見守ってくれていてありがとうございます。",
        "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n谢谢您一直守护着我。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:027866c02e1ef69160ff723449b407902f9e041f0ead9368d7816e700bf7ed0b",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_032nao_1_5_032_00_2:1_5_032_00_2:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_033shr_1_5_033_00_5": {
      "revision": "sha256:d538b91292e4be5403109d916431a917c18405e38f76e37ff8b03109ab79e9c0",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_033shr_1_5_033_00_5:1_5_033_00_5:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "なあ、●●●●プロデューサー！\nオレが一番目立ってただろ？　やっぱそうだよな！",
        "text": "呐，●●●●プロデューサー！\n我刚才最显眼了吧？果然是吧！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:79c23ad7ec2bc3cbdc212475dfebc613ec04c97a86fddd55363a6e6f0401cadc",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_033shr_1_5_033_00_5:1_5_033_00_5:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_033shr_1_5_033_04": {
      "revision": "sha256:3edbc7410b142ee8ddfa63e732b4bb552db932cbd328b0a630e70aafd08f692c",
      "title": 309,
      "opening": {
        "source": "「待てよ！　そっちに行ったらダメだ！\nアイツの罠なんだよ！」",
        "text": "“等等！不能往那边走！\n那是那个家伙的陷阱！”",
        "source_hash": "sha256:54a01c4ac4690de97097ddfcad4bfd9f5e3af57bd3835b6a8fcab59f99998cfe",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_033shr_1_5_033_04:1_5_033_04:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_035mco_1_5_035_02": {
      "revision": "sha256:1f3fcbc270216a94433801b11044437617c67a2f02998d7a93bc23bcf133d223",
      "title": 315,
      "opening": {
        "source": "「シンクの汚れは非常に頑固だ。普通に掃除を\nしていたら、時間がかかってしまう」",
        "text": "“水槽的污垢非常顽固。若是按寻常方法\n打扫，会耗费大量时间”",
        "source_hash": "sha256:a47e88814dc7102e98c94e1c07fc07599dd22e5e18fe7efe7015cbb555929535",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_02:1_5_035_02:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_036rui_1_5_036_00_4": {
      "revision": "sha256:1cd5d825b72d4acbad93b509677d8badd9302001551fa5a5cc61d32da297d79f",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_00_4:1_5_036_00_4:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "今日のlessonはここまで、お疲れさま！\n●●●●プロデューサーちゃんもね！",
        "text": "今天的lesson就到这里，辛苦啦！\n●●●●プロデューサー酱也是哦！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:bbd41b2274cce1d7234e80ead98f6b12c861fe859a9ba5ac08c0b3f66473cd72",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_00_4:1_5_036_00_4:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_037jir_1_5_037_00_3": {
      "revision": "sha256:ea7b6aee3b7c24dace2f5522aa6cd73d1a248e93a6474d67df26bf58487f8a46",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_037jir_1_5_037_00_3:1_5_037_00_3:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "ふわあ……移動時間になったら起こしてくれる？\nおじさん、昼寝してるからさ。",
        "text": "哈啊……等到该出发的时间了能叫醒我吗？\n大叔我先睡个午觉。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:68b8b904ee81a57237ce7bce33b0f99b8b7e3633a9b950a416efdf79c825e438",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_037jir_1_5_037_00_3:1_5_037_00_3:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_038tak_1_5_038_00_0": {
      "revision": "sha256:70c2c421bddd6bce00cb22adaa67c495a07e3fb488cad83bc454f86b675e8ae5",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_038tak_1_5_038_00_0:1_5_038_00_0:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "今日の撮影は長丁場だったな。\nお疲れさま、●●●●プロデューサー。",
        "text": "今天的拍摄耗时很长呢。\n辛苦了，●●●●プロデューサー。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:5d12fe0c3b7c286644706ebb84614a66ea5bcdd0f52520cc97de20d7938b7d7d",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_038tak_1_5_038_00_0:1_5_038_00_0:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_038tak_1_5_038_01": {
      "revision": "sha256:1235d8adef3d1535e84d31492f338c5634f83d33c76e31185b968bee1627e430",
      "title": 326,
      "opening": {
        "source": "綺麗な海だな。\n今日はここでCMの撮影をするのか。",
        "text": "好漂亮的海啊。\n今天是要在这里拍广告吗。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:85063771093ba5b2f9668dba764682944de29eac81ec6223f9b264cd786931cb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_038tak_1_5_038_01:1_5_038_01:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_00_4": {
      "revision": "sha256:27b47de4775e64241e10f04b6eb0df095efe73479dac36030efaf64e78793dab",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_00_4:1_5_039_00_4:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "●●●●●●●●●●師匠、お疲れさまッス！\nははっ、そんなによかったッスか？　どうもッス！",
        "text": "●●●●●●●●●●师父，辛苦了！\n哈哈，真有那么好吗？多谢夸奖！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:996e99bda38c92a62ebd10b95e2c679b469c76216fea3976009cf21d6ecabe0c",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_00_4:1_5_039_00_4:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_040ren_1_5_040_00_7": {
      "revision": "sha256:a872afd647c64387b7ee554c8001b94c2313e4b9d23512eafc1e100449ca62ae",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_040ren_1_5_040_00_7:1_5_040_00_7:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "オレ様を誰だと思ってやがる。トレーニングなんか\nしなくてもヨユーでできるに決まってんだろ？",
        "text": "你以为本大爷是谁啊。就算不做特训，\n这种事肯定也是轻轻松松就能搞定的吧？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:be09a84f86ae2e43241c4c8c2b84d8d4d6394bb9b487ac5d587a5c97fe36fd82",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_040ren_1_5_040_00_7:1_5_040_00_7:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_041ryo_1_5_041_00_2": {
      "revision": "sha256:f3d56cfc0996fc2a637441793ed819ffe06a077f3728d8499a7a13e0fab32751",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_041ryo_1_5_041_00_2:1_5_041_00_2:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "プロデューサーさんのためにも、\nみんなのためにも、全力でやり遂げますね。",
        "text": "为了制作人，\n也为了大家，我会全力以赴完成的。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:f82e343154174538ec150fe5601466eacfa36040f2710e7f81d66da393c03b29",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_041ryo_1_5_041_00_2:1_5_041_00_2:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_042dai_1_5_042_00_8": {
      "revision": "sha256:1d8e9d6986dd56f930e1566eed8acf263e67e5356d20ad760aadba6ea492c81e",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_042dai_1_5_042_00_8:1_5_042_00_8:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "出番待ちで時間ができてしもうたのぉ……。\nそうじゃ！　宿題をするか！",
        "text": "候场多出了些空闲时间啊……\n对了！拿来写作业吧！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:767961b9cca0f02172c0aaa63bc2c1866fde1183b395fa415387b608ebdd7d51",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_042dai_1_5_042_00_8:1_5_042_00_8:cmd-000018:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_00_6": {
      "revision": "sha256:aea3549180983b2c65a556f230aad54f6a816538189e17e0050ecfd15ebe3823",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_00_6:1_5_043_00_6:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "…振り付けの最終確認をしてくる。\n本番でミスをしないためにもな。",
        "text": "…我去对动作进行最后的确认。\n也是为了正式演出时不出现失误。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:cfc90357ebc7d4a15fb5b99889898afd9929830938050ad8f864e7024e585626",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_00_6:1_5_043_00_6:cmd-000014:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_03": {
      "revision": "sha256:b9d51bce288f34d907ab9dbaa1e983cebd564dfe9ebd566ef8b77e57af35664f",
      "title": 348,
      "opening": {
        "source": "…この仕事はおれの趣味が生かせそうだな。\n●●●●プロデューサー、ありがとう。",
        "text": "…这份工作似乎能发挥我的爱好呢。\n●●●●プロデューサー，谢谢你。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:9a7b9053901732f0e0e8e22752219a37cb089aeb84fcbeb436067ce46ba12409",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_03:1_5_043_03:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_044ame_1_5_044_02": {
      "revision": "sha256:ce102e7e6207fbebf709f80afc8e1f62696e36a79be9071cb861d0b7c8652f37",
      "title": 351,
      "opening": {
        "source": "撮影時間が過ぎたが、\nリハーサルすら始められないとはな。",
        "text": "拍摄时间都过了，\n居然连彩排都还没能开始啊。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:af816c26fb287c1db1827793b3a3eab907958b412eeb4303effaf9e195425078",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_044ame_1_5_044_02:1_5_044_02:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_046chr_1_5_046_00_5": {
      "revision": "sha256:3af6f67c62e2fe643213adbf6b883ea0f87a92cb8d4fb61e705c035b624e3cb7",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_046chr_1_5_046_00_5:1_5_046_00_5:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "●●●●プロデューサーさん、\nお疲れさまです。無事に収録が終わり安心しました。",
        "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n辛苦了。录制顺利结束，我也松了口气。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:2cc649c04573eef11327e7d51ff2899f7a9fd039429fa0a91821aa8899c1871d",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_046chr_1_5_046_00_5:1_5_046_00_5:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_046chr_1_5_046_04": {
      "revision": "sha256:6be01549f3e807e4cf9b7bd18a415a164c10f433c2d70aa3e749437d9fb127a9",
      "title": 361,
      "opening": {
        "source": "クリスさん、TV番組の仕事が決まりました。\nこちらが番組の企画書になります。",
        "text": "克里斯先生，电视节目的工作定下来了。\n这是节目的企划案。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:94421d0e06962d7cec0630134d4c967ce10c81f16ede8baa2cb240f4a3506c4d",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_046chr_1_5_046_04:1_5_046_04:cmd-000018:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_047shu_1_5_047_00_6": {
      "revision": "sha256:ab80a5d8fc8920d76a6b84c5a37876642ec2a3a0319176aadd2dd6cc93236b8f",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_047shu_1_5_047_00_6:1_5_047_00_6:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "……え、もうレッスン終わり？\n俺ならまだまだいけるよ。",
        "text": "……诶，训练这就结束了？\n换我的话还能继续练哦。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:002f36fd7bce20331989554e49dcf1e091551b8875e3a2f3ec8c3b2c31a86eb3",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_047shu_1_5_047_00_6:1_5_047_00_6:cmd-000020:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_047shu_1_5_047_03": {
      "revision": "sha256:089cfd1f7f307b3ada5facb1420b4d0d0c24b6ec87da502f34d24b679ceba9c2",
      "title": 364,
      "opening": {
        "source": "本日はテレビ番組のゲストで、他の事務所の\nアイドルの方々と対談していただきます。",
        "text": "今天是作为电视节目的嘉宾，和其它事务所的\n偶像们进行对谈。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:429b39a346754cbe51c582cfac8267b19659a2e400552d5079b89793d73d5714",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_047shu_1_5_047_03:1_5_047_03:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_048mom_1_5_048_00_1": {
      "revision": "sha256:1147f79c1510b70839e282b2062e334e7a357faaf9636cc03bb6ed42c45bc8dc",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_048mom_1_5_048_00_1:1_5_048_00_1:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "もうそろそろ、撮影時間？\nはーい、いってきまーす。",
        "text": "差不多到拍摄时间了吗？\n好——的，我出发啦——",
        "source_hash": "sha256:85bb1e8979b9dc77d194161bdf21f4febf80db78b421140d59d6904d7bbb48b8",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_048mom_1_5_048_00_1:1_5_048_00_1:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_049eis_1_5_049_00_3": {
      "revision": "sha256:11c454c93c15fe85ab47f5f8bc8967fae2bf2adc91759ccb4f2d12664f0c45d3",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_00_3:1_5_049_00_3:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "次の仕事の台本なら、もう頭に入れてある。\n……変更があった？　気にするな、報告しろ。",
        "text": "下一份工作的台本，我已经记在脑子里了。\n……有改动？别介意，向我汇报吧。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:bcbc0cc8a4f34b50c25a8468804ac7b64af81fa1932c674e065d3921b8e758d1",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_00_3:1_5_049_00_3:cmd-000018:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "5_01_009_22_b": {
      "revision": "sha256:c210d62ff0ef93ac9b896320858a23671ea1130fa0461261c2688e16da72aaaf",
      "record": {
        "source": "今度は俺が返す番",
        "text": "这次轮到我回礼了",
        "source_hash": "sha256:2bde28f83ef6119344e0c4ed076232b27c59de3b2859498c2dc87046b6fc8ae7",
        "unit_id": "metadata:v1:seasonal-title:title:2bde28f83ef6119344e0c4ed076232b27c59de3b2859498c2dc87046b6fc8ae7"
      }
    },
    "5_01_018_23_a": {
      "revision": "sha256:07706f6287d486d83d3feb2deb7ff8589d542c3b08fd5ffb010c30a93797121e",
      "record": {
        "source": "話題の一品",
        "text": "热门之选",
        "source_hash": "sha256:ef6cc1f6cbb71407887df69d33979306ff44ae8f271a5a9a6a2c8dcb0f009939",
        "unit_id": "metadata:v1:seasonal-title:title:ef6cc1f6cbb71407887df69d33979306ff44ae8f271a5a9a6a2c8dcb0f009939"
      }
    },
    "5_01_021_23_a": {
      "revision": "sha256:30b2bb02b6c7f4081ebf205746962fd7fc4d4ec63975c54cf23590a5b31c2e1a",
      "record": {
        "source": "想いに応えてみせます",
        "text": "我会回应这份心意",
        "source_hash": "sha256:6ff7ea51bfb9bbe607d757bb3dc7a42d4dda0364d8f34e67e3d931e06e2de926",
        "unit_id": "metadata:v1:seasonal-title:title:6ff7ea51bfb9bbe607d757bb3dc7a42d4dda0364d8f34e67e3d931e06e2de926"
      }
    },
    "5_01_023_22_b": {
      "revision": "sha256:0e84ba94839569c02eba46f8d525409881794cf2b133a54951d34f375e8c7e9a",
      "record": {
        "source": "思いを伝える日",
        "text": "传递心意的日子",
        "source_hash": "sha256:2dd866d83def9f0068932c1d5f6a10ba8b96c8a14b828ed88f641edce6e1ce76",
        "unit_id": "metadata:v1:seasonal-title:title:2dd866d83def9f0068932c1d5f6a10ba8b96c8a14b828ed88f641edce6e1ce76"
      }
    },
    "5_01_026_22_a": {
      "revision": "sha256:93c880b1c823d6b557e698bcb85d4b415f91a21766eff6d7255936ab5765bc97",
      "record": {
        "source": "不撓不屈の精神で",
        "text": "怀着不屈不挠的精神",
        "source_hash": "sha256:11f9acb3c2abac14416c50db60ae8dc0cb066c6f833483041ea235b3db0ecddb",
        "unit_id": "metadata:v1:seasonal-title:title:11f9acb3c2abac14416c50db60ae8dc0cb066c6f833483041ea235b3db0ecddb"
      }
    },
    "5_01_031_22_a": {
      "revision": "sha256:af1d11eb61018bb5b060f391da0f3509900495d87ae9e4f8d9a901da12172408",
      "record": {
        "source": "パピッとハッピー☆",
        "text": "Papi开心☆",
        "source_hash": "sha256:b5c204347732a0aa48180c199cd9b7882fa1c1f8fc65d6ff22b758787b804959",
        "unit_id": "metadata:v1:seasonal-title:title:b5c204347732a0aa48180c199cd9b7882fa1c1f8fc65d6ff22b758787b804959"
      }
    },
    "5_01_034_22_b": {
      "revision": "sha256:8f468851ca7c181c0942631e3808541a87c66156a1f5a3bfa102a5a0db9c3064",
      "record": {
        "source": "バレンタインは……",
